@startuml
[*] --> incomplete

incomplete --> missing_note : compose [no linked note]
incomplete --> missing_source : compose [note exists, no source refs]
incomplete --> evidence_pending : compose [sources linked, excerpt or anchor missing]
incomplete --> supported : compose [note + sources complete]
missing_note --> supported : link note
missing_source --> supported : link sources
evidence_pending --> supported : fill excerpt and anchor
supported --> incomplete : remove note or source
@enduml